{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2020-11", "window": 4, "start_date": 1606089600, "end_date": 1606780799, "month_true_total": 78, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:48:08 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "81294523", "author": {"steamid": "76561197982789608", "personaname": "DrSteinman | Twitch.tv", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DrSteinmanTTV/", "num_games_owned": 1346, "num_reviews": 86, "playtime_forever": 942, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 130, "last_played": 1733519554, "avatar": "85885ab678f9c5942b1e0672506d29850287db5e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Slay the Spire and Borderlands had a weird child. I dig it.", "timestamp_created": 1606777871, "timestamp_updated": 1606777871, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "81293203", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970946760", "personaname": "Xargoth", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970946760/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 3228, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 245, "last_played": 1744316599, "avatar": "f999eded11dd78ede928fb38d48228a84c1ac6a0"}, "language": "english", "review": "I only have a couple of hours on this game so far, but I can definitely see myself putting a lot more into this game especially once it fully releases. I'm not the biggest fan of purchasing early access titles as most of them tend to lack good, meaningful content or are riddled with bugs and issues, but this game is definitely worth the purchase. The soundtrack is phenomenal and the gameplay feels extremely tight and very good. It's a roguelite game, so randomly generated levels but permanent upgrades to carry from run to run are the main aspects of the game. The other aspect that makes this game great are the guns themselves, most of them feeling good to shoot and the variety so far is pretty good, no doubt more to come as the game develops. There isn't many negative things I can say about the game so far, except that it is a bit short and perhaps a bit easy on the standard difficulty (but you can unlock harder difficulties through \"beating\" the game) but otherwise I highly recommend this game to ANYONE who likes good FPS games.", "timestamp_created": 1606777042, "timestamp_updated": 1606777042, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "81178416", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999116444", "personaname": "Jimmy2Toes", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197999116444/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1169, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 397, "last_played": 1750677257, "avatar": "ce2478ba026cb8e9d2a12d9200151d335fe81fc3"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a fun game: fun style, fun music, fun bosses, a pumping soundtrack and great gunplay/gameplay. Plus theres a cute little comic story to add a bit more charm.", "timestamp_created": 1606720074, "timestamp_updated": 1606720074, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "81177489", "author": {"steamid": "765611979